            "review_title": "Review at Sushi Hung Hanare",
            "review_text": "Xavier C\n1 contribution\n0\nDon’t bother…\nNov 2024 • Couples\nWe came in at 8:30 and were welcome by “we close at 9:30”. Not hello, not good evening, just “we close at 9:30” that really meant “please leave, we don’t want you”. There were only 2 persons in the restaurant. So I left and I went somewhere else. I will not ever go again. No idea how they survive.\nWritten November 19, 2024",
