            "review_title": "Review at Sushi Hung Hanare",
            "review_text": "笑屁萎(Shohei)\n1 contribution\n0\nIt was the worst sushi and service dinner I've ever had in my life...\nJan 2024 • Couples\nMaybe it can't be helped because the chef is Vietnamese, but I have never had such bad sushi and miso soup in my life. The service was also terrible and it was a waste of money, so it's not a place I can go to again. It's a complete imitation of SUSHI, VIETSUSHI. It's disappointing.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nShow original\nWritten March 7, 2024",
